  precedent=["HM Treasury Green Book Supplementary Guidance: Optimism Bias (2003); DfT TAG Unit A1.2 (2004 onward)", "NASA NPR 7120.5 section 2.4 and Cost Estimating Handbook v4.0 Appendix J", "10 USC 2334 (WSARA section 101) for CAPE independent estimates; DoDI 5000.02 should-cost provisions"],
  hook="DOE's Loan Programs Office, the UK regulated-asset-base licence and state utility commissions all sit at a financing gate where a JCL-style 70 percent budget and a Green-Book uplift can be required; a nuclear reference class already exists (Flyvbjerg's dataset, MIT's Vogtle-type decomposition).",
