   "GM and Autodesk seat bracket (2018): 40 percent lighter, 20 percent stronger, eight parts to one. Boothroyd Dewhurst Xerox case: part count down 41 percent, manufacturing cost down 45 percent. SpaceX Raptor 3 (2024): about four times lower unit cost than Raptor 1 and 1,100 kg lighter through integral additive channels. [vendor]",
