  precedent=["DoDI 5000.73 and DoDM 5000.04 (cost and software data reporting, 100 million dollar threshold)", "NASA Cost Estimating Handbook v4.0 Appendices A and E", "DoD Cost As an Independent Variable policy (1995)"],
  hook="DOE's ARDP, GAIN and NRIC awards are the place a CADRe-like duty to deposit actual costs could attach; NQA-1 design control is the documentation regime an automated design loop must satisfy.",
